{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近、寒くなってびっくりです!\n寒すぎてマフラーを買いました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN7524BQXVF2FQWHYA1DJX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n防寒対策バッチリ(*b'v･)b+｡\nホッカイロも6個くらい付けてます。足までバッチリでした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯テロします。\nうどん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN76H761AJ1PN189XXYR3X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n2本の太くて長い麺で、出汁がとても美味しかったです!\nパンケーキ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN77J0DVKZ4V249DXYJ0CZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN78NCHPRS0QXH1X90PG8R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n抹茶の風味が最高でした✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶道部の頃を思い出しました🍵"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN79PW47YN7VN0N6SWTST2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n日本食 大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶にハマりつつあります。\nみなさんのお気に入りの冬のご飯は何ですか?\nメッセージとか握手会で教えてね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}